entityDescription:
Farvest is a marketing, publishing and event creator company, with more than 250,000 contacts; 
Farvest informs, entertains, advance industry knowledge with major B2B communities;
Farvest was created in 2000, 19 years of experience and almost 40 brands (PrivateBanker, FundsEvent, Insurtech Summit, ICT Spring, BEAST, Space Forum, HR One, Morpheus Cup, Marketers, IT One, InFinance, IT Day, Automotion…) have made Farvest be considered as a non-standard and respected group in Luxembourg.
